    "kind": "恩",
    "what": {
     "zh": "天没亮，隔着窗塞给你一个煮鸡蛋：「记账，以后还我。」",
     "en": "Before dawn, pushed a boiled egg through your window: \"Keep count. Pay me back.\""
    },
    "chapter": "00-prologue",
    "day": "2026-09-30",
    "at": "00-dawn"
   },
   {
    "who": "laozhou",
    "kind": "恩",
    "what": {
     "zh": "天没亮便顺着你刻的那四十一道记号寻进黑松岭，扛着门板来找你。",
     "en": "Before dawn he followed the forty-one marks you cut into Black Pine Ridge, carrying a door-plank to bring you home."
    },
    "chapter": "00-prologue",
    "day": "2026-09-30",
    "at": "00-cliff"
   },
   {
    "who": "maxiaobao",
    "kind": "仇",
    "what": {
     "zh": "外门的「公中」：收了你一块灵石。",
     "en": "The outer court's \"common fund\": took one of your spirit stones."
    },
    "chapter": "00-prologue",
    "day": "2026-09-30",
    "at": "00-waimen"
   },
   {
    "who": "ahe",
    "kind": "恩",
    "what": {
     "zh": "外门第一天，阿禾在小本子上记了你一笔：杂灵根。你说：哪天不是了，拿本子来对。",
     "en": "Your first day in the outer sect: Ahe wrote you into the little notebook — mixed root. You said: the day it isn't so, bring the notebook and check."
    },
    "chapter": "00-waimen",
    "day": "2026-09-30",
    "at": "wm-ahe"
   },
   {
    "who": "zhouheng",
    "kind": "恩",
    "what": {
     "zh": "十月初八，周衡把药园巡夜令交给了你：「巡夜没好处，没人接。」又把半根蜡烛掰下一截给你。月底盘账，药园要是还在丢，令牌归马师兄。",
     "en": "The eighth of the tenth month, Zhou Heng handed you the herb garden's night-watch token: \"The night watch pays nothing; nobody takes it.\" He broke a piece off half a candle for you too. If the garden is still losing plants at the month-end reckoning, the token goes to senior brother Ma."
    },
    "chapter": "00-waimen",
    "day": "2026-09-30",
    "at": "wm-yaoyuan"
   },
   {
    "who": "maxiaobao",
    "kind": "仇",
    "what": {
     "zh": "十月十二，柴房：马小宝等六人，二十三下。利息，另算。",
     "en": "The twelfth of the tenth month, the woodshed: Ma Xiaobao and five others, twenty-three blows. Interest to be reckoned separately."
    },
    "chapter": "00-waimen",
    "day": "2026-09-30",
    "at": "wm-chaifang"
   },
   {
    "who": "maxiaobao",
    "kind": "仇",
    "what": {
     "zh": "冬月初一，秘境门口，公中：两块灵石。",
     "en": "The first of the eleventh month, at the hidden realm's door, the common fund: two spirit stones."
    },
    "chapter": "00-waimen",
    "day": "2026-09-30",
    "at": "wm-mijing"
   },
   {
    "who": "sunergou",
    "kind": "恩",
    "what": {
     "zh": "宗门大比，孙二狗叫内门的卢方推倒了七回，在石阶上坐下去便起不来了；你伸手把他拉了起来。",
     "en": "At the sect contest Lu Fang of the inner court knocked Sun Ergou down seven times; he sat on the steps and couldn't get up, and you held out your hand and pulled him up."
    },
    "chapter": "00-waimen",
    "day": "2026-10-01",
    "at": "wm-lun1"
   },
   {
    "who": "sunergou",
    "kind": "恩",
    "what": {
     "zh": "大比那天夜里，孙二狗托你替他写一封家信：「娘，我倒了七回，起来了七回。」别写是谁把他打倒的。",
     "en": "The night of the contest Sun Ergou asked you to write a letter home for him: \"Mother, I fell down seven times and got up seven times.\" Not to write who knocked him down."
    },
    "chapter": "00-waimen",
    "day": "2026-10-01",
    "at": "wm-jiaxin"
   },
   {
